---
import Command from './guide/Command.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<section id="install" aria-labelledby="install-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p>
  <h2 id="install-heading">Give your agent a method.</h2>
  <p>Read the <a href={url('rulebooks/swe/#fit')}>adoption guidance</a>, then add Kerby to your agent.</p>
  <Command title="In Claude Code, run each command separately:" ids={['install-marketplace', 'install-plugin']} />
  <Command title="Or add the skill with the cross-platform CLI:" ids={['install-cli']} />
  <Command title="In your agent, load the rules and inspect their status:" ids={['cmd-load', 'cmd-status']} />
  <p class="note">Loading instructions and installing hooks are separate. <a href={url('rulebooks/swe/hooks/#install')}>See setup and platform support →</a></p>
</section>
<style>section { border-top:1px solid var(--border); } h2 { margin:0 0 1rem; }.note { color:var(--secondary); font-size:.95rem; }</style>
